1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,583
Bilbo! Bilbo!

2
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:08,375
My precious.

3
00:00:11,917 --> 00:00:17,000
This is the One Ring,
forged by the Dark Lord Sauron

4
00:00:17,375 --> 00:00:19,875
in the fires of Mount Doom,

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:23,875
taken by Isildur from the
hand of Sauron himself.

6
00:00:24,417 --> 00:00:29,292
Bilbo found it. In Gollum's cave.

7
00:00:29,375 --> 00:00:34,500
Yes. For sixty years the Ring
lay quiet in Bilbo's keeping,

8
00:00:34,583 --> 00:00:38,750
prolonging his life, delaying old age.

9
00:00:38,833 --> 00:00:43,417
But no longer, Frodo.
Evil is stirring in Mordor.

10
00:00:43,542 --> 00:00:48,875
The Ring has awoken.
It's heard its master's call.

11
00:00:49,042 --> 00:00:53,167
But he was destroyed. Sauron was destroyed.

12
00:01:01,792 --> 00:01:04,875
The spirit of Sauron endured.

13
00:01:05,083 --> 00:01:09,292
Frodo, he must never find it.

14
00:01:10,667 --> 00:01:12,625
What must I do?
